@startuml BackupRestoreServer
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Server Admin" as Admin
actor "Scheduler" as Scheduler
actor "File Storage" as Storage

rectangle "Backup & Restore" {
  usecase "Initiate Backup" as UC_Backup
  usecase "Upload Backup" as UC_Upload
  usecase "Record Audit Entry" as UC_Audit
  usecase "Rollback on Failure" as UC_Rollback
}

Admin --> UC_Backup : manual
Scheduler --> UC_Backup : scheduled
UC_Backup --> UC_Upload
UC_Upload --> Storage
UC_Upload --> UC_Audit

' Error/alt flows as usecases
rectangle "Error / Recovery Flows" {
  usecase "Network Failure" as E_Net
  usecase "Storage Quota Exceeded" as E_Quota
}

UC_Backup ..> E_Net : no connectivity
UC_Backup ..> E_Quota : may cause
UC_Upload --> Admin : notifies
E_Net --> UC_Rollback
E_Quota --> UC_Rollback

note top of UC_Backup
Preconditions:
- Admin authenticated
- Server accessible & read permissions available
- Storage reachable & quota available
- Backup format compatible
end note
@enduml